#. Tag: para
#: rlogin.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using &konqueror; you can start up an <command>rlogin</command> "
"session with a server hosting the rlogin service."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: rlogin.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use this kioslave feature, in the &konqueror; <acronym>URL</acronym> "
"bar, type <userinput>rlogin:/host_to_connect_to</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: rlogin.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will initialize &konsole; with an <command>rlogin</command> "
"session, prompting you for your password."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: rlogin.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>rlogin</command> kioslave uses the username of the account you are "
"currently using in &kde;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: rlogin.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have successfully entered your password, you can begin your remote "
"session."
msgstr ""

